# Product Data & Schema

**PG only:** `POSTGRE_URL` — never `MONGO_URI`; no fallback (ADR 004). Alembic owns schema.

**Domain:** `stock` in `schemas/`, `models/`; tables `stocks`, `users`, `orders`, …

**main** keeps v1 Mongo `tea` for demo (ADR 003).

Per-deploy: separate database (or schema) via connection string in buyer `.env`.

`schema_version` on rows: optional; single-deployment migration only.
